  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "電動車伺服馬達與驅動器設計實務",
    "sub_ename": "THE DESIGN PRACTICE OF THE SERO MOTOR AND DRIVE FOR ELECTRIC VEHICLES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要在介紹分析與設計電動車伺服馬達驅動器，其範圍將包括純電動車及混合動力車、電池充電器及充電樁、電動車伺服馬達、交直流轉換器之分析和V2G技術。經由對電動車驅動器知識的認識和理解，學生可以獲得電動車伺服馬達驅動器的應用和區域電網系統集成能力，進一步將該技術應用於相關電動機驅動領域及區域電力電網，提升能源之有效利用。",
    "describe_eh": "The aim of this course is to introduce the analysis and design of electric vehicle servo motor drivers. The scope of course will include pure electric vehicles and hybrid electric vehicles, battery chargers and charging piles, electric vehicle servo motors, analysis of AC-DC converters, and V2G technology. Through the understanding of fundamentals for electric vehicle driver, students can obtain the knowledge and application of electric vehicle servo motor drive.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能用自己的專業詞彙定義何謂電動車伺服馬達驅動器系統，並描述其特性。",
      "describe_en": " Define and describe the characteristics of an electric vehicles servo drive system."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能瞭解並說明電動車伺服馬達驅動器在電機領域的應用。",
      "describe_en": "Understand and be able to explain the applications of an electric vehicles servo drive system in the field of electrical engineering."
    }
  ],
